OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1787084321
OL,3,CConcerns raised over how police handle
OL,4,Cdangerous driving following Kildare
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FQuestions are being asked about how
OL,8,Fpolice handle dangerous driving, after
OL,9,Fa head-on crash in Kildare over the
OL,10,Fweekend.
OL,12,FThe five boys who died at the scene
OL,13,Fhave been named locally as Joe Carthy,
OL,14,FAlex McCarthy, Kamil Pustkowski,
OL,15,FJeremy O'Brien and Jack Kennedy.
OL,17,FFour more people remain in hospital.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
