OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1787084321
OL,3,CConcerns raised over how police handle
OL,4,Cdangerous driving following Kildare
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FThe association representing Gardai
OL,8,Fofficers has told UTV that the lack of
OL,9,Ftraining is hampering the forces
OL,10,Fability to deal with such incidents,
OL,11,Fand the Police Federation for Northern
OL,12,FIreland says not enough officers are
OL,13,Ftrained here either.
OL,15,FFive teenagers died after the car in
OL,16,Fwhich they were travelling in collided
OL,17,Fhead-on with another vehicle after
OL,18,Fgoing in the wrong way down a motorway.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1787084321
OL,3,CConcerns raised over how police handle
OL,4,Cdangerous driving following Kildare
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FInvestigations continue amid grief and
OL,8,Fanger as questions are arising about
OL,9,Fhow to handle dangerous driving.
OL,11,FThe body representing rank-and-file
OL,12,FGardai officers told UTV that a lack
OL,13,Fof training is hampering being able to
OL,14,Fdeal with such incidents.
OL,16,FJohn Joe O'Connell, Garda
OL,17,FRepresentative Association said:
OL,18,F"We're looking for training. There's
OL,19,Fnobody in this country is pursuit-
OL,20,Ftrained to stop a non-compliant driver
OL,21,Fwho fails to stop.
OL,26,@tD@Frt
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1787084321
OL,3,CConcerns raised over how police handle
OL,4,Cdangerous driving following Kildare
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,F"We currently have a serious amount of
OL,8,FGardai across the country who are
OL,9,Fdriving patrol cars who are trained to
OL,10,Fwhat's called CBD1 level.
OL,12,F"Believe it or not, these people
OL,13,Fcannot activate blue lights or sirens.
OL,14,FSo that's where we're starting from in
OL,15,Fthis country."
OL,17,FAn Garda Siochana's Commissioner says
OL,18,Fpursuit training for Gardai is
OL,19,Fexpected to begin by the end of the
OL,20,Fyear.
OL,26,@pD@FrtyD@KrtyD@OrpzD@[rt
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1787084321
OL,3,CConcerns raised over how police handle
OL,4,Cdangerous driving following Kildare
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FMeanwhile, the PSNI says it offers
OL,8,Finitial phase pursuit training to all
OL,9,Fresponse officers, depending on
OL,10,Ftraining opportunities available.
OL,12,FHowever, a spokesperson for the Police
OL,13,FFederation says the organisation
OL,14,Fbelieves public safety here is at risk.
OL,16,FIn a statement, they told UTV: "Due to
OL,17,Flimited resources and an ineffective
OL,18,Fbudget, there are not as many officers
OL,19,Fas they operationally need to keep
OL,20,Fboth the public and themselves as safe
OL,21,Fas they should be."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1787084321
OL,3,CConcerns raised over how police handle
OL,4,Cdangerous driving following Kildare
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FOne former PSNI officer says this
OL,8,Fissue goes far beyond funding.
OL,10,FAlan Mains, Former PSNI Detective
OL,11,FSuperintendent said: "And it's all
OL,12,Fvery much about risk assessment.
OL,14,F"And I think the police officers
OL,15,Fthemselves need to sort of weigh up
OL,16,Fthe situation at that time. You know,
OL,17,Fthere's no point in chasing them
OL,18,Fthrough town in a busy built-up area
OL,19,Fbecause you're automatically going to
OL,20,Fput the public at risk.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1787084321
OL,3,CConcerns raised over how police handle
OL,4,Cdangerous driving following Kildare
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,F"If you go into a night time
OL,8,Fenvironment where there's very little
OL,9,Ftraffic on the road, then that's maybe
OL,10,Fa different scenario.
OL,12,F"But we'll always be command-and-
OL,13,Fcontrol led, and they will instruct
OL,14,Fthe police as to what they should do."
OL,16,FWhile discussions around public safety
OL,17,Fon roads continue, three women and a
OL,18,Fyoung boy remain in hospital.
OL,20,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,21,FITVX
